{"unit_id":"lovedheart__dsh-plugin-token-usage#card-zh","repo":"lovedheart/dsh-plugin-token-usage","commit":"2358b54298c98c7ee4144eaca190196161a27790","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-token-usage 是一个 DSH Web 插件，用于汇总各会话中模型调用的 token 用量。它从本地持久化的会话日志增量读取数据，按日期、服务提供方和模型累计输入、输出、缓存及调用次数，并保存扫描水位以便重启后继续处理。用户可以通过 /usage 查看指定时间范围的汇总，也可以在 Web 设置页打开 Token 用量面板，查看 7、30、90 天统计、按日图表和模型明细。它适合需要了解不同模型在多个 DSH 会话中的用量的人。插件不需要 API Key 或外部账号，会读取 DSH 会话目录，并将聚合结果写入本地状态文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:99-107","src/index.js:150-205","src/client/TokenUsagePanel.tsx:162-218"]}
{"unit_id":"lovedheart__dsh-plugin-token-usage#card-en","repo":"lovedheart/dsh-plugin-token-usage","commit":"2358b54298c98c7ee4144eaca190196161a27790","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-token-usage aggregates token use across DSH sessions. It scans local logs and groups input, output, cache counts and calls by date, provider and model. Use /usage or the Web settings panel for date ranges, daily charts and model details. No API key is needed; aggregate state stays local.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:99-107","src/index.js:150-205","src/client/TokenUsagePanel.tsx:162-218"]}
